# Code ownership (kingdoms — source of truth).
# The ruleset on main requires a code-owner review (1 approval); this file
# maps every path to its owner. Mod rule/environment docs are owned by the
# mod's game designer; governance, conventions and sync scripts stay
# maintainer-owned.

## Default: a maintainer reviews everything not explicitly delegated
*                       @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers

## Mod docs & rules: owned by the mod's designer — mod-only changes never
# require a maintainer review; each mod is delegated by one explicit line
# (added in the mod's own bootstrap PR).
/docs/MODS/kingdoms/     @Drasahaoe
/docs/MODS/marriage/    @Drasahaoe
# Unclaimed mod docs stay maintainer-reviewed until their designer is
# onboarded and the delegation line is added:
# /docs/MODS/ladder/     @<designer>
# /docs/MODS/register/   @<designer>

## Governance and process docs
/AGENTS.md              @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/docs/DECISIONS/        @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers

## Sync scripts: they regenerate generated/ROADMAP.md and generated/DEPENDENCIES.md
/scripts/               @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers

## Contributors roster: the source of truth for roles and teams
/CONTRIBUTORS.md      @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
